      "path": "docs/records/spec-lean-code-store.md",
      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "A module containing `#check (sql_file \"a.sql\")` reads the file, but Lean restores the environment after `#check`, so no `SqlSourceUse` survives for the byte-hash check to inspect. Fix: Require SQL read records to survive environment restoration before relying on them to validate every SQL input."
    },
    {
      "id": "20261122T125706Z-d491267b#2",
      "line": 192,
      "path": "docs/records/spec-lean-code-store.md",
      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "should",
      "text": "Lake also includes package-level `extraDepTargets` in each library module’s trace, so the library can track an SQL input without listing it in `needs`. Fix: State that the repository template uses `needs` to include the SQL input in the trace."
    }
  ],
